    34                          ; This absolute listing was generated to ease software
    35                          ; development on ADAM. This listing provides the location
    36                          ; of both released and unreleased entry points. Released
    37                          ; entry points begin immediately in this file with the jump
    38                          ; table and end before the first code segment listed.
    39                          ; Released entry points include the jump table, common data
    40                          ; areas(EOS_COMM), common data tables, and equates which
    41                          ; describe the released data structures. Direct access
    42                          ; to code segments is STRONGLY DISCOURAGED and may make
    43                          ; your application incompatible with some ADAMs. There is
    44                          ; more than one version of EOS on the market at this time
    45                          ; and updates are planned.
