  6035                          ;***************************************************************
  6036                          ;
  6037                          ;
  6038                          ;     TRIM_FILE RELEASES THE UNUSED BLOCKS IN THE SPECIFIED FILE
  6039                          ;
  6040                          ; NOTE:  IF FILE BEING TRIMMED IS THE LAST FILE, THE UNUSED BLOCKS ARE
  6041                          ;        ALLOCATED AS PART OF THE REMAINING AVAILABLE BLOCKS (RETURNED
  6042                          ;        TO THE HOLE).
  6043                          ;
  6044                          ;     INPUT:  A       DEVICE ID
  6045                          ;             DE      POINTER TO FILE NAME STRING
  6046                          ;
  6047                          ;     OUTPUT:
