  7000                          
  7001  1566  211600                    LD      HL,PRINT_BUFFER
  7002                          
  7003  1569  cd8015                    CALL    __START_PR_BUFF
  7004                          
  7005  156c  c9                        RET
  7006                          
  7007                          
  7008                          
  7009                          
